OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSome hazy sunshine in the
OL,6,Fsoutheast at first otherwise rather
OL,7,Fcloudy. Dry for much of the day then
OL,8,Fsome outbreaks of rain later. Quite
OL,9,Fwarm.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy evening with
OL,12,Foutbreaks of rain, some may be heavy
OL,13,Fat times. Remaining cloudy through the
OL,14,Frest of the night with the risk of
OL,15,Ffurther rain.
OL,16,
OL,17,CSunday:FA rather cloudy day with
OL,18,Foutbreaks of mostly light rain.
OL,19,FConditions will turn drier from the
OL,20,Fnorth through the afternoon with some
OL,21,Fbrighter intervals developing.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
