OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FMainly
OL,6,Fdry, bright and increasingly warm or
OL,7,Fvery warm during this period, with
OL,8,Fvariable amounts of cloud and some
OL,9,Fhazy sunny spells.
